{
  "name": "info-public",
  "description": "Identify the discovered bridge without authentication. Contract 1.2: management_endpoints gives the bridge web interface on each confirmed management path (url, path home or hotspot, tls); open the url as given, never build one. Empty when the bridge does not know.",
